Significance: minor
Type: added

A new Email page in the Events menu lets an administrator email users without going through an event: all users, users with chosen roles, or, while RSVPs are turned on, users who RSVP'd to any event in the past 30, 90, 180 or 365 days. Users who turned event updates off are skipped, and the message goes out from cron in batches. `gatherpress_site_message_active_days` changes the active windows on offer, and `gatherpress_site_message_subject` the subject.
